      "content": "it feels like life is just a horrible mistake sometimes. like we're all just being punished for things we didnt do. if i could just control how it ends... if i could just leave before they come through the doors and take everything from me. would that even be bad? to just choose to go on my own terms instead of letting them do it to me?",
